    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's just that \"taking a step back\" feels like a joke at this point. like, if i take a step back, i just lose more ground. everything is just so heavy. it feels less like i need a nap and more like i just need it all to stop. the noise, the debt, the expectations... it's just constant. i feel like i'm drowning and everyone is just standing on the shore telling me to breathe.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
