      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your pain is valid, and it would never be a joke to rest when you are drowning; the world does not collapse because you pause. Please reach out to a professional who can hold space for the specific weight of your debt and grief, as they can help you navigate when we all seem to be shouting on the shore while you struggle beneath the waves. You are not alone in this struggle, and your voice matters even when the other people's voices are deafeningly loud.",
